---

The Merkle transparency log in `alelyon.verify` follows the tree construction and
proof algorithms described in RFC 6962 (Certificate Transparency), including its
0x00/0x01 leaf and interior node domain-separation prefixes. RFC 6962 is an IETF
standards-track document; no code from any Certificate Transparency
implementation is included here.
